      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T03:54:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the module doesn\u0027t have a bazel_module.label prop, an earlier change made it such that ConvertedToBazel, which is eventually called from GetBazelLabel right before generateBazelBuildActions here [1] and here [2], would return the label as seen by bp2build. \n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/genrule/genrule.go;l\u003d541;drc\u003d6648045f00180435e2e9d7cffd18aabe9133e1e2\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/cc.go;l\u003d1608;drc\u003dmaster\n\nThis check prevents these labels from being generated if they don\u0027t have a bp2build converter. In the cc case, it was actually generating labels for cc_library_static and other cc_* rules since the GenerateAndroidBuildActions codepath is shared between cc.Module types.",
      "parentUuid": "131bf67a_138b994f",
      "revId": "75ea02d17fbb7612ed7545c44c1f9c5dc8d22bc4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
