      "writtenOn": "2021-03-23T16:16:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it perhaps be more complete to be a bit more consistent about recursive allowlisting/denylisting behavior?\n\nThat is, suppose we have:\n  x is True\n  x/y is False\n\nWhat is x/y/z? I would say, it should be False. Under this implementation, it would be True.",
      "revId": "75ea02d17fbb7612ed7545c44c1f9c5dc8d22bc4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
